      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It feels severe to me. It just comes and goes. I've also had a bit of a cough with exercise. With bit of a cough with exercise, I'd say mild. It comes and goes. I've also been feeling unfit.",
